ArCode-Core is a dual-licensed project. The license that applies to a given
file depends on its nature:

| Files                                                       | License      | Reason                                                      |
| ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| `dictionary.json`, definitions, documentation (`*.md`)      | CC-BY-SA 4.0 | Protects the standard from fragmentation and keeps improvements open |
| `validate.js`, scripts, and build tooling                   | Apache 2.0   | Protects the code and allows companies to use the tools freely |

The full texts of both licenses are provided in this repository:

- Apache License 2.0: see `LICENSE-APACHE-2.0`
- Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International: see `LICENSE-CC-BY-SA-4.0`

If you are unsure which license applies to a file, default to the terms
of the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International license.
